{"reviews":[{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-0","r":5.0,"t":"Great for 40+ crowd","x":"I have been looking for highly pigmented neutral pallet that was not overly sparkly against my 44 year old skin. This is it. I tried both this an the Naked Ultimate. This is more pigmented and shows wonderfully.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-1","r":1.0,"t":"Do not recommend buying on Amazon","x":"I am always skeptical about buying name brand items on Amazon but after reading the reviews, I decided to give this Tarte eyeshadow pallet a try. It looks exactly like the one from Tarte.com. Even similar in price. But after using this product a handful of times now, I DO NOT recommend it. I have other eyeshadow pallets from Tarte and their shadows are well pigmented and go on with such ease. You can normally get so much onto your brush with one swipe. But, as you can see in my photos, I literal","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-2","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t blend, broken color","x":"This just didn\u2019t seem like high quality, expensive, eyeshadow to me.  I like tarts tinted moisturizer and cheek tint so thought I\u2019d like it.  It just doesn\u2019t go on smoothly at all, very hard to blend.  Also, one of them colors, probably the one I\u2019d use most often as a base color was cracked when I opened the package.  Wish I hadn\u2019t let the return window go by.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-3","r":5.0,"t":"Good buy","x":"This was my first time to buy a Tarte product and I absolutely love it. I was worried the power may come in cracked or broken, but it arrived in great condition. It also comes with a instruction page for some cute eye ideas to use with the colors. I have used it 4 days this week and the product shows up great on my fair skin.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Love these eyeshadows, they are creamy and pigmented and the beautiful packaging is a plus too","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-5","r":3.0,"t":"Crap compared to Urban Decay","x":"Crap compared to Urban Decay. I covered this palette for month and it was a huge let down. I only like a few of the shades. Not as pigmented if soft as UD. I'm running back to them.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product","x":"This product is well pigmented and applies smoothly and stays on well. The colors are gorgeous and you can create many looks with the different shades. Love this product !","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-7","r":3.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money","x":"Color pay off not very good. I have other Tarte palettes and they are great. I wouldn\u2019t recommend this one, colors are light and chalky when applied.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-8","r":2.0,"t":"I wonder if this make up is old because some people really like it but when I got mine it was barely ...","x":"Definitely does not compare to a naked palette ...  I wonder if this make up is old  because some people really like it but when I got mine  it was barely pigmented  You could get a better  pallet somewhere else  sad because I like this brand to \u2639\ufe0f A lot of the brown colors look more  Orange brown  \ud83e\udd28\ud83d\ude11 I would just say it\u2019s ok but not for the  price.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-9","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE, LOVE, LOVE","x":"I love tarte cosmetics & this truly did not disappoint.  The case/presentation is stunning.  And I LOVE the colors, they are beautiful.  And the quality is fabulous too.  And I love that they are gluten free.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-10","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Excellent and original the most important part","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-11","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"Cute colors but not as vibrant as I hoped.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-12","r":3.0,"t":"It's ok","x":"The color's arent as pigmented as I would've imagined coming from Tarte. The quality of the container itself including the mirror is really great though. The lighter colors are really nice. The darker colors take a lot of product to reach the full effect however.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-13","r":5.0,"t":"Love this!","x":"These colors stay on all day and the set is a good combo of options.  I feel like it's good value, but if you are traveling light, it's not light.  Recommend for the lovely case and colors and quality.  Happy with my purchase!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-14","r":5.0,"t":"My new favorite!!","x":"This is AMAZING!! I'm more of a Too Faced type but I'm soooo in love with this palette, its definitely my new favorite!! Very high pigmented, and hardly any falls off while applying! True meaning of a little goes a long way!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-15","r":5.0,"t":"Favorite","x":"Love love love this palette! So pigmented and blends out so well and stays on literally all day without using eyeshadow primer. One of the best palettes I've ever bought!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-16","r":5.0,"t":"You'll love this palette!!!","x":"I LOVE this palette!! The colors are vibrant and easily blended for the perfect look. You will not be disappointed with this purchase!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-17","r":5.0,"t":"Love these neutrals!","x":"Absolutely love the colors and quality.  Nice pigmentation so you don't need to apply as much.  Great product!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-18","r":5.0,"t":"gorgeous new you","x":"love the colors and love the texture!  so happy i get no irritation from these products!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-19","r":3.0,"t":"Three Stars","x":"I expected a dryer powder but it\u2019s kind of \u201cbuttery\u201d and thick with a bit more sheen.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-20","r":5.0,"t":"Authentic product.","x":"Beautiful packaging, came in perfect condition. It is authentic.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-21","r":1.0,"t":"Is this real tarte who knows","x":"Item arrived broken inside. All the colors mixed together.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-22","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Absolutely love this pallet. Tarte has amazing products","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-23","r":4.0,"t":"Hermosa paleta","x":"Ha sido una muy buena compra. Los colores son hermosos, ideales para crear looks neutros. Algunos son pulverulentos otros se compactan bastante en la paleta, sin embargo en el ojo el resultado es muy bueno, incluso a lo largo del dia. El empaque de la paleta es absolutamente precioso.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B00XWNLIWG-24","r":3.0,"t":"Long lasting and good pigment, bad setting.","x":"I love the colors in this palette. However, I've been using it for about 1 month and the shadow comes off in chunks with my brush. I've never had an eye shadow wear that way. It'll be gone way before it should be because so much is wasted.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the palette as highly pigmented and smooth to apply.","cites":[1,5,7,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the colors not pigmented enough, light, or chalky.","cites":[8,9,12,13]},{"text":"Reviewers frequently compliment the beautiful packaging and case.","cites":[5,10,13,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers report blending problems or a cracked/broken shade on arrival.","cites":[3,4]},{"text":"A few reviewers compare it unfavorably to other palettes like Urban Decay's Naked.","cites":[6,9]}]},"qa":[]}